  ['Sign in as an Admin at the test location.', 'Use a desktop browser window 1440 pixels wide, at 100% zoom.', 'Have a new open work order for this test for customer B with customer A picked as its Bill To, so a work order bills a customer other than its own.', 'Put customer A on Credit Hold (Edit Customer, Credit Terms: Credit Hold).', 'Start on the work order page.', 'Open the attached picture bt-p3-17-after-change-bill-to.png at 100% zoom beside the screen.'],
  ['Click Change Bill To in the banner.'],
  [['The page scrolls to the customer card.', 'The Bill To field is focused with its list open.', 'The "[customer B\'s name] (this customer)" row is first.']],
