# DV-02
C('D-62', S, 'Design: Bill To lock toasts carry a Close button',
  ['Sign in as an Admin at the test location.', 'Use a desktop browser window 1440 pixels wide, at 100% zoom.', 'Have a new work order for this test for customer B billed to customer A that has been invoiced (Invoiced or Paid), so a work order bills a customer other than its own.', 'Open the attached pictures bt-p3-04-after-click.png, bt-p3-08-after-click.png, bt-p3-11-after-click.png at 100% zoom beside the screen.'],
  ['Open the work order.', 'Click the Bill To value.'],
  [['The work order opens.'], ['The red toast shows "Go To Invoice" and, after it, a white "Close" button.', 'For a user without Finance tab access the toast shows only "Close" and has no caption line.']],
  ['S5-R2', 'S5-N1'],
  marker='AUTOMATION: HOLD - the design differs from the PRD, waiting on the PO (question 5)')
